    "message": "Integrate pinned corpus acceptance and backend runtime gates\n\nPrepare exact source and dependency pins without changing upstream module\nfiles. Require every compile/lint cell, repeat, command profile, and raw-log\nhash, while preserving decorder as an explicit incomplete analysis.\n\nAdd stock-baselined assembly, purego, plugin, cgo, and modernc runtime checks,\nwith explicit compatible plugin and reviewed capability profiles. Preserve\nhistorical failures and the successful Go 1.27.4 gglint CI evidence.\n\n167 Python tests and 27 subtests pass; strict types, formatting, workflow\nvalidation, and named negative controls pass. Actual corpus execution is\nstill required. The compiler source tree is unchanged.",
